# Linux/WSL WSL2 / Python 3.12 CUDA runtime. Compile with uv 0.11.17 using this
# file as both input and --overrides to pin upstream's floating VCS dependencies.
# FlashAttention is deliberately not installed: the separately qualified runtime
# selects AMAGO's official SlidingWindowFlexAttention(window_size=96).
